<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Files sent by {{.SenderEmail}}</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:24px;background-color:#ffffff;color:#1a1a1a;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;">
<div role="main" style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;">
<h1 style="font-size:20px;margin:0 0 16px;">{{.TenantName}}</h1>
<p>Hello,</p>
<p><strong>{{.SenderEmail}}</strong> sent you files through the {{.TenantName}} transfer service.</p>
{{- if .Message}}
<p>Their message:</p>
<blockquote style="margin:0 0 16px;padding:8px 16px;border-left:4px solid #767676;white-space:pre-wrap;">{{.Message}}</blockquote>
{{- end}}
<p><a href="{{.Link}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 20px;background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;border-radius:4px;">Download the files</a></p>
<p>If the button does not work, copy this address into your browser:<br><span style="word-break:break-all;">{{.Link}}</span></p>
<p>The files are available until {{datetime .ExpiresAt}}.</p>
{{- if .PasswordRequired}}
<p><strong>This transfer is protected by a password. The password will be sent to you by another channel; it is never written in this message.</strong></p>
{{- end}}
{{- if .QR}}
<p>You can also scan this QR code to open the download page:<br><img src="cid:qr@transteira" alt="QR code of the download link" width="180" height="180" style="display:block;margin-top:8px;border:0;"></p>
{{- end}}
<h2 style="font-size:18px;margin:24px 0 8px;">Files</h2>
<ul style="padding-left:20px;margin:0 0 16px;">
{{- range .Files}}
<li style="margin:0 0 12px;"><strong style="word-break:break-all;">{{.Name}}</strong> ({{size .Size}})<br>
<span style="font-size:14px;">SHA-256: <code style="font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;word-break:break-all;">{{.SHA256}}</code></span>
{{- if eq .NotScanned "too_large"}}<br>
<span style="font-size:14px;"><strong>Not scanned by the antivirus:</strong> the file is too large or too complex to be fully analyzed.</span>
{{- else if eq .NotScanned "encrypted"}}<br>
<span style="font-size:14px;"><strong>Could not be analyzed by the antivirus:</strong> encrypted archive.</span>
{{- end}}</li>
{{- end}}
</ul>
<p style="font-size:14px;">The SHA-256 fingerprint of each file lets you check that the downloaded file is intact.</p>
<p>Do not forward this message: anyone who has the link can download the files.</p>
<p>{{t "mail.footer.ignore"}}</p>
<hr style="border:0;border-top:1px solid #767676;margin:24px 0 16px;">
<p style="font-size:14px;color:#4a4a4a;">{{t "mail.footer.automated" "tenant" .TenantName}}</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
